  "coverage": {
    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "backend= and mode= keyword values on torch.compile are not stated: omega-python emits call.method for the callee name only and publishes no argument fields, so no join reaches a string literal",
      "a decorator is not linked to the declaration it decorates: tree-sitter-python puts the decorator outside the function_definition node, so neither span direction of fact_join_by_span relates reference.decorator to definition.function",
      "torch._inductor.config assignments (ind_cfg.max_autotune = True) are not stated: omega-python emits definition.variable only for an identifier left-hand side at module scope",
      "an aliased compile binding (from torch import compile as tcompile) is matched only where the alias is spelled compile; binding.import_alias carries its target as an attribute, which the overlay cannot read",
      "Inductor IR, graph breaks, lowering, generated kernels and backend-specific runtime compilation are runtime-generated and are not executed"
    ]
  },
